#: ../../source/base64-js_README.md:26
msgid ""
"`base64js` has three exposed functions, `byteLength`, `toByteArray` and "
"`fromByteArray`, which both take a single argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/base64-js_README.md:28
msgid "`byteLength` - Takes a base64 string and returns length of byte array"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/base64-js_README.md:29
msgid "`toByteArray` - Takes a base64 string and returns a byte array"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/base64-js_README.md:30
msgid "`fromByteArray` - Takes a byte array and returns a base64 string"
